                <stringValue>Salesforce converts this applicant to a Person Account and enrols them in their cohort automatically (RTS Flow 10), within a minute of the status change. Open the Lead (it now links to the Person Account), check Related → Program Engagements shows the cohort with Stage = Enrolled, then mark this task Complete. If you also have an &quot;Enrol by hand&quot; task for this person, follow Section 6.9 of the coordinator guide.</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
